MODULE: BindingConvergesStaleScanNotRejected
TARGET: BindingConverges
CLASS: Temporal
SUMMARY: a stale captured source is never rejected so a topology move strands the rebuild
PERTURBS: RejectStale

--- FIND
RejectStale ==
    /\ ~Idle /\ candidate # alias
--- REPLACE
RejectStale ==
    /\ FALSE
    /\ ~Idle /\ candidate # alias
--- END
